OL,3,GNEWSAThames Water grateful as use falls
OL,4,Aafter hosepipe ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemand has fallen about 3% across
OL,7,FLondon, while exceptionally dry ground
OL,8,Fconditions have increased pressure on
OL,9,Fburied pipes, the company said.
